Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Original Work, Story & Character Design\NAkira Toriyama (Shueisha "Jump comics")
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hee, hee hee!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Time to adventure!\NYou'll be hooked for sure!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Demon Realm is full of mystery{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}DAIMA wonderland{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whoopsie daisy!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when your heart shrinks\NAnd you feel low{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.79,0:00:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams are everywhere\NDon't worry about it{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Never give up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:01:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Here comes a New Story{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thousands of jabs and silly jokes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They're waitin' for you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Jaan! Jaka jaan!\NThe fanfare of courage{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No-holds-barred battles\NThe excitement ain't stoppin'{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey Shenron, grant my wish{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wanna meet\NSomeone amazin' again tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:43.93,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,TRUE STRENGTH
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Vegeta!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Vegeta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you got yourself eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.05,0:02:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!\NI'm not used to having a child's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like he got\Njust the warmup he needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-He can use magic, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spin, spin, spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can do it, Duu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.31,0:04:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Duu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to eat chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be stupid! You're in\Nthe middle of an important battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want chocolate! I want chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want chocolate! I want chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:04:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want chocolate! I want chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go buy some!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want chocolate! I want chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want chocolate! I want chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.35,0:05:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want chocolate! I want chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he actually winning\Nagainst a Tamagami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To think that such an individual exists…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They said they liked to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just helped them out a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Tamagami-sama is fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Tamagami is fighting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Duu! Some chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it fighting?\NIt couldn't be one of them, could it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not. Look, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well. I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! Yay! Woo hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I don't believe it! He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spin, spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spin, spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done, Duu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ha-hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done fighting and winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And now for the final challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.53,0:09:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can win,\Nthen the Dragon Ball is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Arinsu…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that? Is he Arinsu's servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Arinsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.06,0:10:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The final challenge is…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,mental arithmetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You must add all of the numbers\Nthat appear here and give your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And now…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:11:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now give your answer! What is the sum?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,N-No one can do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even I can't! That's cheating!\NThis is a scam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Answer the sum of the numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,683,775,029.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you give up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,683,775,029.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C-Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just what is he…?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.87,0:12:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done, Majin Duu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.66,0:12:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spin, spin, spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My assist was pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh come on. All you did was watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be… She actually took\Nthe Dragon Ball from the Tamagami.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,P-Perhaps Arinsu is protecting the Ball\Nfrom the ones who came from Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine that she'd do something\Nso generous for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! The last one better still be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Of course. I-It's still safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'll check right away! Hold on a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh come on! When did he learn to do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's been training by himself for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.69,0:17:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well now, this is quite a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now for the final challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.89,0:17:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you clear this,\Nthe Dragon Ball is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, there's still more?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here is your question.\NYou have ten seconds to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,M-My question?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Majin child Johnny gets 15 biscuits\Nfrom his mother and goes for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After eating one-third of the biscuits,\NJohnny encounters Jiro the goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jiro asks for half of the remaining\Nbiscuits, so Johnny hands over half.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Jiro worries he was too greedy\Nand returns two of the biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Johnny then meets Saburo the dog\Nand gives him a biscuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but Shiro the monkey suddenly appears\Nand steals three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Johnny continues on,\Nkeeping his anger under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He then encounters Ichiro the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The kind Johnny decides\Nto give Ichiro the rest of his biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How many biscuits was Ichiro able to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh… Oh no…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Vegeta's no good at\Nthese sorts of problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Five seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Four seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Z--…\N-Z-Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.57,0:19:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said zero biscuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.07,0:19:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The question was\Nhow many biscuits Ichiro was able to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You said Ichiro is a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Snakes don't eat biscuits, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why… it's zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.35,0:19:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take the Dragon Ball with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! Not bad, Vegeta!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done, Vegeta!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice going!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forgive me.\NI was unable to protect the Dragon Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, this is how things should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You fought quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was amazin'! You actually solved\Nthat really hard problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We had snakes on Planet Vegeta, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you are really,\Nreally strong after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, I'll dance a victory dance for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Wanna eat one of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:20:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:21:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're Medi Bugs called Revive Bugs\Nthat we bought in the Third Demon World!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.09,0:21:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They heal you and\Nrestore your stamina like Senzu Beans!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.47,0:21:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Who can eat a bug?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that.\NYou used to be fine with eating critters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.31,0:21:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm more refined now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't talk like someone refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.36,0:21:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And at long last, to rescue Dende-san\Nand get the third Dragon Ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,let us head to the First Demon World!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.51,0:21:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Is something not working?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The engine isn't starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty old after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.47,0:21:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on. Lemme take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.57,0:22:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.70,0:22:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Th-They…{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.37,0:22:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They got the\NSecond Demon World Dragon Ball, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They'll be coming to\Nthe First Demon World.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.23,0:22:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Holding out my hand{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Up to the sky{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The moment is ours{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.37,0:22:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Make a miracle happen{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:23:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Like a bird with open wings we fly{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Picking up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Those pieces of hope{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.30,0:23:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There's no giving up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Go as far as we can{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.15,0:23:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I got you by my side{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Run, run, run{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over the mountain we go{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.45,0:23:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I hear it always\NYour voice in my heart{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.28,0:23:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"You know that we're never alone"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:45.54,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,SURPRISE
